## ObjectType: Executed Trade

Actual or explicitly planned fill of an order. Contractual amount uses quote factor; it is neither settled cash nor regulatory risk exposure.

### Semantic Provenance

| Key | Value |
|---|---|
| source_iri | https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/FBC/FinancialInstruments/FinancialInstruments/SecuritiesTransaction |
| source_label | securities transaction |
