### Data Properties

| Name | Display Name | Type | Description | Mapped Field |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| trade_id | Trade Id | string | Stable unique identifier of this business record. | trade_id |
| order_id | Order Id | string | Foreign key to trade_orders; blank only where contract declares absent/inapplicable evidence. | order_id |
| trade_date | Trade Date | date | Date of this business event under the fictional weekday calendar; distinguish planned and actual. | trade_date |
| trade_quantity | Trade Quantity | decimal | Positive business quantity in the linked instrument’s share or face units. | trade_quantity |
| execution_price | Execution Price | decimal | Local-currency quote in the linked instrument basis; apply price_multiplier. | execution_price |
| gross_amount | Gross Amount | decimal | Booked positive contractual consideration = quantity × execution quote × price factor rounded half-up per trade to 2dp in instrument currency. Actual contractual totals and trade-date FX translation must use this recorded gross_amount, not an unrounded reconstruction. | gross_amount |
| currency | Currency | string | Instrument denomination; must agree across trade, instruction, opening and position. | currency |
| trade_status | Trade Status | string | Operational fill state executed/planned; actual/planned instead describes view_kind. These fields are not interchangeable. Allowed values: executed, planned. | trade_status |
| known_date | Known Date | date | Date this fact/assumption was available; actual facts cannot use future knowledge, planned assumptions are known by 2027-02-28. | known_date |

